  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING ROOM \u2014 The Three Seasons: unbroken SUN -> RAIN -> SUN -> WIND macro-contraption! Burn the skylight bramble in SUN, push & angle the mirror onto the buoy, flood in RAIN and latch the elevation pin, return to SUN to bounce the skylight beam through the iron grate, drop the spore orb on the launch pad, and flip WIND to blow the spore across the 8-tile abyss onto the scale for the Boss Key!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Full synthesis of all three Mausoleum weathers (SUN bramble+optics, RAIN buoy lift, WIND spore ferry).",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 75,
    "reward": "ms_boss_key+ms_east_shortcut",
    "why": "Signature astonishing contraption of The Rain Mausoleum awarding the Choir Boss Key and Cycle 3 shortcut.",
    "exit": "exit_ms_r8_west",
